.TH WAVE-LINKQUERY 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-linkquery \- Show which version the versionless shortcut points at.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave linkquery <package> | wave linkquery \-\-all
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show which version the versionless shortcut points at.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-all, \-a
Apply to every installed package

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave linkquery jq
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
